(Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) combines a retrieval module) Tj T*
(with a text generation model. The retrieval module searches an) Tj T*
(external knowledge base for passages relevant to the user query.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Key benefit: answers are grounded in source documents, which) Tj T*
(reduces hallucination and enables citation of sources.) Tj T*
