(A vector database stores text embeddings and supports fast) Tj T*
(similarity search. Popular choices include Qdrant, Milvus and) Tj T*
(Weaviate. Qdrant supports payload filtering, which allows the) Tj T*
(system to restrict search results by metadata fields such as) Tj T*
(domain, category, topic and status.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Chunking strategy matters: chunks that are too small lose) Tj T*
(context, while chunks that are too large dilute relevance.) Tj T*
ET
